# Legacy exclusion list for older published runtimes whose
# install/omarchy-other.packages predates install/omarchy-other-aarch64.packages.
# New aarch64-only optional packages belong in install/omarchy-other-aarch64.packages
# in omacom/omarchy instead, so x86_64 builds never see them in the first place.
# Keep these names here until every channel's published runtime ships the split.
acer-aspire-16-ai-audio
anduril-bluechip-support
asus-proart-p14-audio
asus-proart-pz13-audio
asus-zenbook-a16-audio
asus-zenbook-a16-firmware
asus-zenbook-a16-support
asus-zenbook-14-ux3480qa-audio
hp-omnibook-3-audio
iptsd
microsoft-surface-laptop-7-support
microsoft-surface-laptop-8-support
microsoft-surface-pro-11-sensors
microsoft-surface-pro-11-support
microsoft-surface-snapdragon-addresses
raspberry-pi-4-bluetooth-firmware
samsung-galaxy-book4-edge-14-support

# The same packages under the names omarchy-pkgs used before it renamed them.
# A stable image reads these lists from the stable omarchy package, which names
# them this way until it is released with the new names.
asus-proart-p14-speaker-firmware
surface-laptop-8-support
surface-pro-11-sensors
surface-pro-11-support
